OL,3,ALetting agent accused of not returning
OL,4,Adeposits to more than 100 tenants
OL,5,
OL,6,FA letting agent has been accused of not
OL,7,Freturning the deposits of more than 100
OL,8,Ftenants.
OL,10,FTony Singh, whose company Morgan, Payne
OL,11,F& Knightly has multiple branches in
OL,12,FBirmingham, Telford and Wolverhampton,
OL,13,Falso faces accusations from landlords,
OL,14,Fwho say he did not pass rent on to
OL,15,Fthem.
OL,17,FUnpaid sums have in a handful of cases
OL,18,Fseen county court judgments made
OL,19,Fagainst both the company and Singh -
OL,20,Fwho goes by Tony, but whose full name
OL,21,Fis Amun Singh Judge. Each has also been
OL,22,Freported to Trading Standards.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
