OL,3,ALetting agent accused of not returning
OL,4,Adeposits to more than 100 tenants
OL,5,
OL,6,FA BBC investigation can now shine more
OL,7,Flight on the scale of money owed,
OL,8,Funcovering evidence that tenants and
OL,9,Flandlords are between them out of
OL,10,Fpocket by hundreds of thousands of
OL,11,Fpounds. Some fear they will never see
OL,12,Ftheir money.
